    "body": "Heavy lane run before marking ready: `cargo test --release -p camcraft-motion --test rotary_adaptive -- --ignored`.\n\n- `the_developed_window_reaches_the_planner_and_names_each_refusal`: ok\n- `adaptive_plans_the_developed_levels_under_the_load_and_kink_laws`: **fails, but identically on upstream main e8a7f59** (`radius 6.5: load 19.9% D past 14.6% + 35%`, rotary_adaptive.rs:242). The failure predates this PR. It looks related to #55 (a narrowed helix overloads on a small window).\n\nThis PR changes no golden, and the existing wraps are byte-identical.\n",
